g fun. The Goat likes that you can bring your own booze to this place and they serve your vodka back to you with a bartender. Very very surprised to see banker that Goat keeps his money with having fun here and so sad that banker pretended not to see the Goat when he waved at him. The Goat met many kind and gentle people here that are very much into \"swinger\" type lifestyle. Goat is not so sure this type of life is for him but it looks like people..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"U6TaNdaXXVr-_izmLVQyTg","photo_id":"Yo5bKagAYgIpYp2MYPV8JQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Yo5bKagAYgIpYp2MYPV8JQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.97255539894104},{"business_id":"U6TaNdaXXVr-_izmLVQyTg","photo_id":"gsw9LcodnMZMxxEaFboIvg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/gsw9LcodnMZMxxEaFboIvg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9725552797317505}]},"notebook_case":null}
